	// R| # rank inversion method available directly from rq() by setting ci=TRUE, with br=TRUE.
	// R| # these summary methods are intended primarily for comparison purposes
	// R| # and for use on large problems where the parametric programming methods
	// R| # of rank inversion are prohibitively memory/time consuming.  Eventually
	// R| # iterative versions of rank inversion should be developed that would
	// R| # employ the Frisch-Newton approach.
